      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "「堅固な鎧」と「鍛えた投げ槍」と「強いツキ」……\nあたしゃ、その3つを武器に戦場を渡り歩いてきた。\nけど、最近ヤワな連中しか相手をしてなくて退屈さ。\nあたしに久しぶりに「恐怖」を教えておくれよ。",
        "official_en": "Sturdy armor, a well-honed spear, and luck. These\nthree things have served me as I stride across the\nworld's battlefields. Yet I tire of fighting the weak...\nIndulge me!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
