      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あたしの鎧と投げ槍程度じゃ、\nあんたにゃあ、まるで歯が立たなかったね……\nでも、やっぱツイてる。充分「恐怖」を味わえた。\nあたしの技は、どうぞ好きに使っておくれよ。",
        "official_en": "My armor and spear were no match for your blade,\nbut luck was with me, because I finally tasted fear\nwhen we fought. Please, use my technique as\nyou will.",
        "real_en": null
      },
